    <briefdescription>
<para>Computes structural diffs between two TableSchema instances. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The engine is stateless; create a single instance and call <ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_schema_diff_engine_1a02d840844833c0672e082e402f0076b8" kindref="member">diff()</ref> as many times as needed. All comparisons are purely value-based — no database connection is required.</para>
<para>Algorithm:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Build name-keyed maps of PropertyInfo and IndexInfo for both schemas.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Walk the union of property names to classify each as ADDED / REMOVED / TYPE_CHANGED / NULLABILITY_CHANGED / INDEX_CHANGED. A property may produce multiple <ref refid="structthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_column_diff" kindref="compound">ColumnDiff</ref> entries when more than one attribute changed.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Walk the union of index names to classify each as ADDED / REMOVED / CHANGED (type, uniqueness, or column list differs).</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Sort both result lists alphabetically by name for deterministic output.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">SchemaDiffEngine<sp/>engine;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_schema_diff_engine_1a02d840844833c0672e082e402f0076b8" kindref="member">diff</ref><sp/>=<sp/>engine.diff(old_schema,<sp/>new_schema);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!<ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_schema_diff_engine_1a02d840844833c0672e082e402f0076b8" kindref="member">diff</ref>.isEmpty())<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>std::cout<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_schema_diff_engine_1a02d840844833c0672e082e402f0076b8" kindref="member">diff</ref>.toJSON().dump(2)<sp/>&lt;&lt;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;\n&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
